      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-07-15_WidnesExaminer_art0061" n="art0061">
        <head>Bed and Table Linens.</head>
        <p>Bed and Table Linens.</p>
        <p>Damask Table Cloths, Sheets, Pillow Cases, Towels, Bedspreads, Quilts, and even Blankets, are a thoroughly good investment at the Sale Prices. In every instance the quality standard is maintained at its highest notwithstanding the drop</p>
        <p>in price.</p>
