        <p>STOCKTON HEATH. A FATAL SKID. Whilst crossing Swan-street, Manchester, Mrs. Margaret Atkinson (64), wife of Mr. George Atkinson, of London-road, Stockton Heath, was knocked down and killed by a motor car, which skidded on the greasy street after the brakes had been put on. At the inquest at the City Coroner's Court on Wednesday a verdict‘ of " Accidental death" was returned. • PRIVATE JACK MeINTYRE. • Crack Shot Wounded While Working Machine Gun. In last week's issue we published the news that Private Tack Mclntyre, son Of Mr. and Mrs. William Mclntyre, of Stockton Heath, was missing after the tremendous fighting on the Ist</p>
